The '''Mining Fiesta''' is an [[Event]] that occurs when {{NPCSprite|Cole;Mayor Cole}} is elected as Mayor with his {{AN|Mining Fiesta}} perk active,  perk or {{NPCSprite|Candidate Jerry;Mayor Jerry}}'s {{AN|Perkpocalypse}} perk is rotated to a '''Mining Fiesta'''.

During the '''Mining Fiesta''', players mining on public islands can obtain {{Item|Refined Mineral}}s and {{Item|Glossy Gemstone}}s.

== Overview ==
The event lasts the entirety of {{NPCSprite|Cole}}'s mayoral term, provided his {{AN|Mining Fiesta}} perk is active.

=== Mechanics ===
During the '''Mining Fiesta''', on {{green|Public Islands}}:
* {{Stat|mining wisdom|+25}};
* {{Stat|Mining Fortune|+25%}};
*Ability to buy {{Item|Fiesta Flask}} and {{Item|Packrat Shard}} from {{NPCSprite|Brynmor}}:
**{{Item|Fiesta Flask}} grants {{Stat|Mining Fortune|+25%}} and {{Green|+100%}} chance to finding a {{Item|Refined Mineral}} and {{Item|Glossy Gemstone}} for {{Green|1}} hour during fiesta.
**{{Attr|Fiesta Fortune|I-X}} ({{item|Packrat Shard}}) grants {{Stat|Gemstone Fortune|5-50}} during fiesta.
* Additionally, players can collect:
** {{Item|Refined Mineral}}s from [[File:Lapis Lazuli Ore.png|21px|link=]] [[Ores]], [[File:Lapis Lazuli Block.png|21px|link=]] [[Pure Ores]] and [[File:Polished Diorite.png|21px|link=]] [[Dwarven Metals]];
** {{Item|Glossy Gemstone}}s from [[File:Lime Stained Glass.png|21px|link=]] [[Gemstone]]s.

Their chances:
* scale with the {{stat|bp}} of the block mined;
* can be increased through other means;
* are '''not''' penalized on blocks broken through {{stat|mining spread}}, {{stat|gemstone spread}} and [[Heart of the Mountain#Pickaxe Abilities|Pickaxe Abilities]] such as [[Heart of the Mountain#Pickaxe Abilities|{{AN|Pickobulus}}]] or [[Heart of the Mountain#Pickaxe Abilities|{{AN|Sheer Force}}]].

<math>\displaystyle\text{Chance} = \frac{{\color{darkgreen}\text{Breaking Power}}}{5,000}\times \left( 1+ \sum{\text{Multipliers}}\right)</math>
:Where <math>\sum{\text{Multipliers}}</math> is the sum of the multipliers.

