== Trivia ==
* The '''Mining Fiesta''' was previously called the '''National Mining Month''' and only took place during {{Season|m=LSU}} and {{Season|m=EAU}}. This was changed to accommodate players living in multiple time zones, by splitting them into {{green|2}} events, then into {{green|5}}: following this last change, one of them eventually became bugged since it was scheduled before the beginning of the election.
